  "id": "greek-baklava",
  "name": "Greek Baklava",
  "subtitle": "Crisp phyllo layered with spiced walnuts and lemon syrup",
  "description": "A classic Greek-style dessert of buttery phyllo and cinnamon-scented walnuts finished with chilled lemon syrup.",
